{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 27, :comments ["<b>And they shall place My name.</b> Like the meaning of 'to place His name there,' that they shall be consecrated by the name. Or its meaning is: when they mention My name over them, for in each of the three verses is the revered and awesome Name." "<b>And I will bless them.</b> It is possible that the mem of 'I will bless them' is a sign for the priests who bless, or it may be a sign for Israel, and the meaning is: if they bless them, I will bless them. And the meaning, in my opinion, is that I will fulfill their blessing. The mem of 'I will bless them' is a sign for all of them, priests and Israelites."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 6, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:16:40.898786150Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}